  "articleBody": "Sometimes, a small ding in your drywall is something you can easily tackle, but other times, it's a job for the pros. How do you know when it's time to call in someone like HH Remodeling LLC? Well, if the damage is really extensive, we're talking about large sections that are crumbling or falling apart, that's a big signal. Recurring damage is another red flag; if you've patched it once and it keeps coming back, there's an underlying issue that needs to be diagnosed and fixed properly, especially if it's water-related. Also, if you suspect there are hidden problems like mold growing behind the walls, or if the damage is near electrical outlets or plumbing, please don't mess with it yourself. Those situations require a professional's expertise to ensure safety and a durable repair. Getting an expert in means they can figure out the root cause and make sure the repair lasts, so you don't have to worry about it again anytime soon.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}